      },
      {
        "heading": "What markets and services drive Amazon Web Services' federal obligations?",
        "body": "Computing Infrastructure Providers, Data Processing, Web Hosting, and Related Services drives most obligations with $382M in FY2026 to date. Computer Systems Design Services contributes $19M, and Custom Computer Programming Services contributes $261K. Small amounts appear in research and development services with $500."
      }
